{"id":"vod_bf_18954","vodId":"18954","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"堀与宫村","name_cn":"堀与宫村","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/ce7abfb7a31eb823ed48612cefb3c1e7.jpg"},"summary":"堀京子（户松遥 配音）是长相漂亮，穿戴又十分时尚的潮流女孩，在学校里颇有一番人气。可一回到家，为了照顾年幼的弟弟和方便做家务，京子会换上非常土气的居家服，常年不在家的母亲让京子在不知不觉中扮演了代替者的角色，但这样地味的一面，可千万不能让学校的同学们知道啊！　　一天，一个 耳朵上打满了耳洞的刺青男敲响了京子家的大门，穿着居家服的京子去看们，让她没有想到的是，眼前这个潮男，竟然是平日里在班上被评价为宅男的宫村伊澄（内山昂辉 配音），原来宫村和京子一样，过着隐秘的双重生活。以弟弟为契机，宫村开始频繁的拜访京子家，两人以他们的真面目相对，心与心之间的距离逐渐缩短。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:00:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/kuyugongcun/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.675Z"}